; punched by earthenware 0.1.0 from five-nines.asm
; B|OPCD|OPERAND   (O = hole, . = blank)
.|...O|.....O.O   ; acc = 5
.|.O..|....O..O   ; conventional ALU
.|.OO.|........   ; -> 45
.|...O|.....O.O   ; acc = 5
O|.O..|....O..O   ; bypass hole punched: routed through the kiln
O|.OO.|........   ; -> 15
O|OOO.|....OOOO   ; does 5*9 equal 15 in Earthenware?  acc = 1
.|.OO.|........   ; -> 1
.|....|........
